summary:
  The artist check looks for one name inside the other on the art fold.

history:
  That was the rule on 2026-11-02. The art fold takes dots and hyphens out,
  so "t.A.T.u." was "tatu" inside "art tatum" and "will.i.am" was "william"
  inside every Williams, and a stranger's row counted as the artist's own.

target:
  package/contents/ui/SearchLogic.js

